<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_105> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#chp_الثالث__تنظيم_السلطات_والفصل_بينها_sec_الثاني__الحكومة> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_105" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "إذا أسفرت الانتخابات التشريعية عن أغلبية رئاسية ، يعين رئيس الجمهورية وزيرا أول ويكلفه باقتراح تشكيل الحكومة وإعداد مخطط عمل لتطبيق البرنامج الرئاسي الذي يعرضه على مجلس الوزراء ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_105> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_105_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_105_20201101_OpEnact_1e472f5425> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2020-11-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "المادة 105" ;
    dzdoc:position 104 ;
    dzdoc:specifiesCondition <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_105_condition_0_56e5246b> ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:council_of_ministers,
        dzterm:government,
        dzterm:president,
        dzterm:prime_minister .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_11> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#chp_الأول__المبادئ_العامة_التي_تحكم_المجتمع_الجزائري_sec_الثاني__الشعب> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_11" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "تمتنع المؤسسات عن القيام بما يأتي : الممارسات الإقطاعية، والجهوية، والمحسوبية، إقامة علاقات الاستغلال والتبعية، السلوك المخالف للأخلاق الإسلامية وقيم ثورة نوفمبر."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_11> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_11_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_11_20201101_OpEnact_65e1c834ee> ;
    dzdoc:imposesObligation <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_11_obligation_0_3deb17c3> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2020-11-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "11" ;
    dzdoc:position 10 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_117> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#chp_الثالث__تنظيم_السلطات_والفصل_بينها_sec_الثالث__البرلمان> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_117" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يبقى البرلمان في إطار اختصاصاته الدستورية، وفيا لثقة الشعب وتطلعاته ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_117> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_117_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_117_20201101_OpEnact_8df6bd1858> ;
    dzdoc:imposesObligation <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_117_obligation_0_211be344> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2020-11-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "المادة 117" ;
    dzdoc:position 116 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:parliament .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_14> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#chp_الأول__المبادئ_العامة_التي_تحكم_المجتمع_الجزائري_sec_الثالث__الدولة> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_14" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "تمارس سيادة الدولة على مجالها البري، ومجالها الجوي، وعلى مياهها. كما تمارس الدولة حقها السيد الذي يقره القانون الدولي على كل منطقة من مختلف مناطق المجال البحري التي ترجع إليها."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_14> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_14_para_0>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_14_para_1> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_14_20201101_OpEnact_b68695ca45> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2020-11-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "المادة 14" ;
    dzdoc:position 13 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:state .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_163> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#chp_الثالث__تنظيم_السلطات_والفصل_بينها_sec_الرابع__القضاء> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_163" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "القضاء سلطة مستقلة. القاضي مستقل، لا يخضع إلا للقانون ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_163> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_163_para_0>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_163_para_1> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_163_20201101_OpEnact_039f730c44> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2020-11-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "المادة 163" ;
    dzdoc:position 160 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:judge,
        dzterm:judiciary .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_164> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#chp_الثالث__تنظيم_السلطات_والفصل_بينها_sec_الرابع__القضاء> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_164" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يحمي القضاء المجتمع وحريات وحقوق المواطنين طبقا للدستور."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_164> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_164_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_164_20201101_OpEnact_725b34e4c9> ;
    dzdoc:imposesObligation <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_164_obligation_0_8158191c> ;
    dzdoc:introducedBy <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:introducedOn "2020-11-01"^^xsd:date ;
    dzdoc:number "المادة 164" ;
    dzdoc:position 161 ;
    dzdoc:usesTerm dzterm:judiciary .

<https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_174> a dzdoc:Article ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#chp_الثالث__تنظيم_السلطات_والفصل_بينها_sec_الرابع__القضاء> ;
    dzdoc:eId "art_174" ;
    dzdoc:fullText "يحمي القانون المتقاضي من أي تعسف يصدر عن القاضي ."@ar ;
    dzdoc:hasAmendmentEvent <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_174> ;
    dzdoc:hasParagraph <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_174_para_0> ;
    dzdoc:hasStatus dzdoc:StatusOriginal ;
    dzdoc:hasVersion <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#version_art_174_20201101_OpEnact_a26aef165c> ;
    dzdoc:imposesObligation <https://legal.dz/resource/constitution/2020-11-01/2020#art_174_obligation_0_17e66270> ;
